WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.046
- [Baldenna Tha King] Houston rap to me is

00:00:03.046 --> 00:00:05.024
the backbone of hip-hop,

00:00:05.024 --> 00:00:07.124
but the music that I make is different.

00:00:07.124 --> 00:00:09.060
♪ Trailride in my city ♪

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.169
There's no one in my lane
that's doing what I'm doing.

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:15.547
I'm Baldenna Tha King,
and I make trail ride rap.

00:00:15.547 --> 00:00:20.547
♪ "Trailride in My City,"
by Baldenna Tha King ♪

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.594
(country music)

00:00:23.594 --> 00:00:26.378
Trail riding is basically our culture,

00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:29.029
is basically what we love to do.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:31.279
It's really a lifestyle.

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:33.009
If you not here to witness it,

00:00:33.009 --> 00:00:35.075
then you wouldn't understand it.

00:00:35.075 --> 00:00:37.239
Back in the day, the people
before my grandfather,

00:00:37.239 --> 00:00:39.579
they used to saddle up
they mule, they donkey,

00:00:39.579 --> 00:00:42.210
backpacking through the
woods and they made a trail.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:44.960
Well we don't have woods no more.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.408
So we ride up and down the streets,

00:00:48.408 --> 00:00:52.491
two by two, in a line,
representing trail riding.

00:00:53.899 --> 00:00:55.760
Riding trucks, playing mud, ride horses,

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.518
get on the party wagon.

00:00:57.518 --> 00:01:01.070
We probably be four hours,
probably be five hours.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:04.070
The numbers vary into the thousands.

00:01:05.469 --> 00:01:06.859
We have our own community.

00:01:06.859 --> 00:01:08.219
We have our own little world.

00:01:08.219 --> 00:01:11.448
You know, you got your blues
and you got your zydeco.

00:01:11.448 --> 00:01:13.870
That's a Cajun-style of music
that come from Louisiana

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:16.808
that's played by a band, an accordion,

00:01:16.808 --> 00:01:21.058
a rubboard, lead guitar,
some people use keyboards.

00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:23.897
Growing up as a young kid,

00:01:23.897 --> 00:01:26.628
I was always on a horse, trail riding.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:30.560
So what I did was, I interpret
all that into my music.

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.219
♪ He wasn't born in this country life ♪

00:01:32.219 --> 00:01:33.888
♪ I knew he wasn't raised right ♪

00:01:33.888 --> 00:01:35.560
♪ Got a taste of this country girl ♪

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:39.143
♪ My homie went ray rights ♪

00:01:41.019 --> 00:01:41.919
Well when I started rapping,

00:01:41.919 --> 00:01:45.470
there was really no rap
allowed on trail ride.

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.439
I came in and I wanted to change that.

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:49.640
Trying to break the
barrier for young people

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.879
to enjoy trail ride
because I was a youngster

00:01:51.879 --> 00:01:54.312
out there on the trail ride.

00:01:54.312 --> 00:01:56.848
If you had a hobby such as trail riding,

00:01:56.848 --> 00:01:58.440
it'll pull you away from the street.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:02:00.739
I know because it's a lot
of people that trail ride

00:02:00.739 --> 00:02:04.574
that used to sell drugs,
that used to, you know,

00:02:04.574 --> 00:02:07.310
do a lot of stuff that wasn't right.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.727
Now they come to trail riding,
and they love my music.

00:02:14.829 --> 00:02:16.168
♪ I'm hard pressed up for money ♪

00:02:16.168 --> 00:02:17.699
♪ Trailride in my city ♪

00:02:17.699 --> 00:02:18.968
♪ We party in the club ♪

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.670
♪ Trailride in my city ♪

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.688
♪ It ain't nothing but love ♪

00:02:22.688 --> 00:02:25.559
The music that I make is just
for the culture I represent

00:02:25.559 --> 00:02:28.720
just for the trail riders,
just for the zydeco artists,

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.970
just for everything that we do country.

00:02:32.887 --> 00:02:34.729
I really feel like I had
something to do with it,

00:02:34.729 --> 00:02:37.139
the changing of the face of trail riding.

00:02:37.139 --> 00:02:39.722
(hip hop beat)

